      "content": "It's natural to question any idea of \"inherent value\" when you're in this much pain, and I hear how exhausting it feels to keep going when you feel so empty. Sometimes, finding a purpose isn't about a grand contribution to the world, but about finding a small, quiet comfort for yourself right now. Even just noticing a patch of sunlight or the feeling of a blanket can be a tiny anchor point. Please consider reaching out to a professional who can help you navigate these deep feelings of meaninglessness.",
